s":["&曹操\n……元让。\n&夏侯惇\n嗯？\n&曹操\n我从小就认识袁绍，\n他对我有很大影响。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n袁绍和我有些相似之处，\n我們也曾經有過相同的夢想。\n&夏侯惇\n………\n&曹操\n他这一死，我多少有些感伤啊。\n&夏侯惇\n嗯……我明白了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n唉，算了。\n说起来我这个人，\n也不太适合感伤。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好吧，这次远征的目的达到了。\n全军凯旋返回许都。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n喔！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n请等一下。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯？文若，有什么事？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n主公，我军凯旋回许都之前，\n顺便进攻别的地方吧？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，你是指刘备吗？\n&荀彧\n正是。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n刘备等人如今于穰山建立根据地，\n集结附近的山贼增加兵力。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n我们去消灭他怎么样……？\n&曹操\n好吧，可不能空手回许都。\n把他们消灭吧！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好！去穰山。\n攻打刘备！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3851,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["連弩騎兵特性設置"]},"end":97,"end_off":4438},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3876,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1852],[]]},"end":80,"end_off":4012},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["注意：\n從本關開始，連弩騎兵維持「必定爆擊」\n的技能。"]},{"op":114,"name":"ext_command","args":[5,"51\n4\n14\n1\n必定爆擊，位置，連弩騎兵"],"ext":{"sub":5,"fn":"learn_skill","nums":[51,4,14,1],"text":"必定爆擊，位置，連弩騎兵"}},{"op":9